<https://github.com/DynamicalSystemsGroup/sysml-concept-reference/id/profile/port-usage>
    dct:description "Describes an interaction point in a structural context, typed by a port definition." ;
    rdf:type inv:ConceptProfile ;
    inv:caveat "The pinned XMI overview overgeneralizes referentiality; the profile preserves the nested-port qualification rather than silently applying that overview as an unconditional rule." ;
    inv:concept <https://github.com/DynamicalSystemsGroup/sysml-concept-reference/id/SysML/20250201/Systems-Ports-PortUsage> ;
    inv:evidence <https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/2.0/Language/PDF#page=327>, <https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/2.0/Language/PDF#page=95> ;
    inv:evidenceStatus inv:EditorialSummary ;
    inv:hasExample <https://github.com/DynamicalSystemsGroup/sysml-concept-reference/id/example/port-usage> ;
    inv:hasNotation <https://github.com/DynamicalSystemsGroup/sysml-concept-reference/id/notation/port-node-boundary>, <https://github.com/DynamicalSystemsGroup/sysml-concept-reference/id/notation/port-reference-restrictions> ;
    inv:hasRelationship <https://github.com/DynamicalSystemsGroup/sysml-concept-reference/id/profile/port-usage/relationship/1>, <https://github.com/DynamicalSystemsGroup/sysml-concept-reference/id/profile/port-usage/relationship/2>, <https://github.com/DynamicalSystemsGroup/sysml-concept-reference/id/profile/port-usage/relationship/3> ;
    inv:learningPoint "A connection referencing a port does not by itself establish a flow or an executable transfer.", "A port usage can appear as a full node or as a small boundary glyph; its semantic identity is not determined by the drawing size.", "Only port definitions can type a port usage. Conjugated typing uses ~ and reverses in/out while preserving inout.", "The source overview and well-formedness constraints need to be read together: nested-port exceptions prevent an unconditional rule that every nested port value must be non-composite." ;
    inv:profilePage "concepts/port-usage.md" ;
    inv:profileStatus inv:DraftSourceChecked .

