<https://github.com/DynamicalSystemsGroup/sysml-concept-reference/id/profile/port-usage/relationship/2>
    dct:description "Port usages can be nested in part usages." ;
    rdf:type inv:ConceptRelationship ;
    inv:condition "Nesting is contextual; a glyph placed on a boundary is not itself evidence of a new ownership rule." ;
